  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteText: "The Creature seemed to be growing at a steady rate, all according to
    the plan, and I\ndon\u2019t know if it\u2019s just the isolation getting to me
    but I feel like it\u2019s increasing in size more\nrapidly... No one else has
    commented on this, so I could just be seeing things \u2013 but I\nknow for sure,
    that tank can only hold so much."
