  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  noteText: "Everyone here is a bunch of frauds. We signed up for this mission and
    I\u2019ll be damned\nif we don\u2019t finish it. We knew what we were getting
    into, why back out now??\nForming a mini resistance are you kidding me?? We\u2019re
    THIS close to fulfilling our\nduty and NOW you wanna stop?! I\u2019ll keep going.
    If no one else will I\u2019ll be the one to\nmake sure this Creature \u2013 My
    Creature \u2013 is a success."
